<title>GREECE: Bank/Greece sells dollars - dealers.</title>
<headline>Bank/Greece sells dollars - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's central bank intervened and sold an unspecified amount of dollars for drachmas, driving ecu/drachma below 311 around 310.20/70 in hectic trading, dealers said.</p>
</text>
